---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Models" description="What Grok models are: the xAI language model line including Grok 4.5 and Grok 4.6.">
  <section class="about-content">
    <p class="home-kicker" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Products</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Models</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle muted">The core Grok language models from xAI.</p>
    <p><strong>Grok</strong> is xAI's family of large language models. Public releases include <strong>Grok 4.5</strong> and <strong>Grok 4.6</strong>, positioned for reasoning, coding, knowledge work, and longer agentic tasks.</p>
    <h2>What models are for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Chat and general reasoning</li>
      <li>Coding and technical work</li>
      <li>Multi-step agent-style workflows when paired with tools and harnesses</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How this relates to other products</h2>
    <p>Models provide the underlying intelligence. Surfaces such as <a href="/bot">Grok Bot</a>, <a href="/build">Grok Build</a>, <a href="/imagine">Imagine</a>, and <a href="/voice">Voice</a> are how that intelligence is delivered for specific jobs.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/products">← All products</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>